{"version":1,"key":"card:764","content":{"id":764,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cc5b6ff0-f12c-4c99-b1fe-354f6f24684e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JavaScript 使用 UTF-16 对 Unicode 字符进行编码，如果码点在 U+0000 到 U+D7FF 和 U+E000 到 U+FFFF 的字符可以用一个 16 位码元表示（中间被挖掉的是代理区），如果超出了这个范围，就需要使用两个 16 位码元表示，这两个码元就是代理对，代理对分为高位代理（0xD800 - 0xDBFF）和低位代理（0xDC00 - 0xDFFF）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fe657d08-09f4-4733-ba6f-d425622ee00c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但如果只有高位代理没有低位代理，或者只有低位代理没有高位代理，这种落单的码元称为 lone surrogates（孤立代理码点），它是不合法的 Unicode 序列，在某些场景下会直接报错或者产生意外结果。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"2815c5c8-7e15-4494-a5db-119f203fb404","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5dfa9349-410a-4f70-9af3-3bee749d87c4","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const illFormed = \"https://example.com/search?q=\\uD800\";\n\nencodeURI(illFormed);\n// URIError: URI malformed","collabId":"05199498-a3e9-424f-a470-625a1b2baf0d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9124d227-9bf4-4507-8def-855c20233601","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因此在消费前，我们需要确保字符串是良好格式化（well-formed）的，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"String.prototype.toWellFormed"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数就是做这件事的，它会将字符串中的孤立代理码点替换为 Unicode 替换字符 �（U+FFFD）。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"a82dff43-df4d-4c3c-9084-6474a3c5efe7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ea288e31-b131-4926-bfe9-edf64e345d51","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 正常字符串（无变化）\n\"hello\".toWellFormed(); // \"hello\"\n\n// 包含孤立代理码点\n// \\uD800 是一个高位代理，没有对应的低位代理\nconst badString = \"abc\\uD800def\";\nconsole.log(badString); // \"abc\" + 孤立代理 + \"def\"\nconsole.log(badString.toWellFormed()); // \"abc�def\"\n\n// 只有低位代理\nconsole.log(\"xyz\\uDC00\".toWellFormed()); // \"xyz�\"\n\n// 合法的代理对（不会替换）\n// \\uD83D\\uDE00 是 😀 (U+1F600) 的代理对\n\"hello\\uD83D\\uDE00\".toWellFormed(); // \"hello😀\"（保持不变）\n\n// 混合情况\n\"ab\\uD800cd\\uDC00ef\\uD83D\\uDE00\".toWellFormed(); // \"ab�cd�ef😀\" —— 只有孤立代理被替换","collabId":"378d0379-3ee3-4438-9ad4-2e9e1ce8c03b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fefb4d03-5ea9-4af4-8f4e-0d6e084a0200","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"String.prototype"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中还存在一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"isWellFormed()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数，用来判断字符串中是否存在孤立代理码点，如果不存在则返回 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示是合法的 Unicode 序列，否则返回 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"9e0ef8cf-ee17-4128-b5cc-c7a4a582fed1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"57ebfcc2-04bf-465f-b741-9d2354a1750d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const bad = \"hello\\uD800world\";\nconsole.log(bad.isWellFormed()); // false\n\nconst fixed = bad.toWellFormed();\nconsole.log(fixed); // hello�world\nconsole.log(fixed.isWellFormed()); // true","collabId":"7b21d46e-2308-427e-9102-416522329afd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/字符串/toWellFormed","JavaScript/字符串/isWellFormed","编码"],"createTime":1782189908913,"updateTime":1782191177173,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1782191177173}}